,"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, we set point $$$(0, 0)$$$ to group $$$A$$$ and points $$$(0, 1)$$$ and $$$(1, 0)$$$ to group $$$B$$$. In this way, we will have $$$1$$$ yellow number $$$\\sqrt{2}$$$ and $$$2$$$ blue numbers $$$1$$$ on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, we set points $$$(0, 1)$$$ and $$$(0, -1)$$$ to group $$$A$$$ and points $$$(-1, 0)$$$ and $$$(1, 0)$$$ to group $$$B$$$. In this way, we will have $$$2$$$ yellow numbers $$$2$$$, $$$4$$$ blue numbers $$$\\sqrt{2}$$$ on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1270E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1270/problem/E"}